  {
   "start": 472.95,
   "end": 476.95,
   "text": "But they sound the same, no? Je mange, tu mange."
  },
  {
   "start": 476.95,
   "end": 478.95,
   "text": "What was to do again?"
  },
  {
   "start": 479.95,
   "end": 480.95,
   "text": "Faire."
  },
  {
   "start": 480.95,
   "end": 481.95,
   "text": "And I do?"
