   "start": 487.95,
   "end": 488.95,
   "text": "Tu fais."
  },
  {
   "start": 488.95,
   "end": 491.95,
   "text": "And both of these are spelled F-A-I-S."
  },
  {
   "start": 491.95,
   "end": 502.95,
   "text": "So with I-R-E verbs, like faire, like attendre, for I and for you, we add an S rather than the E and ES, we add in the case of ER verbs."
  },
  {
   "start": 502.95,
   "end": 512.95,
   "text": "So in the case of faire, we have removed our ending, the R-E, verb ending, the thing that shows us it to do, and then I did S."
  },
  {
   "start": 512.95,
   "end": 515.95,
   "text": "The S is silent, of course, and we get fait."
  },
  {
   "start": 515.95,
   "end": 518.95,
   "text": "To wait, no, is also an I-R-E verb, attendre."
  },
  {
   "start": 518.95,
   "end": 524.95,
   "text": "So if you want to say I wait, we remove the I-R-E ending and we add an S. How do you think it might sound?"
  },
  {
   "start": 526.95,
   "end": 527.95,
   "text": "Je tente."
  },
  {
   "start": 527.95,
   "end": 533.95,
   "text": "So if we remove the I-R-E ending and we add an S, we are left with A-T-T-E-N-D-S."
  },
  {
   "start": 533.95,
   "end": 535.95,
   "text": "Are we going to hear all of that?"
  },
  {
   "start": 536.95,
   "end": 537.95,
   "text": "Je tente."
  },
  {
   "start": 537.95,
   "end": 538.95,
   "text": "Good. Je tente."
  },
  {
   "start": 538.95,
   "end": 545.95,
   "text": "No, because when we remove the I-R-E ending, we have no E on the end making us hear the consonants before."
  },
  {
   "start": 545.95,
   "end": 549.95,
   "text": "The D and the S just become one consonant cluster that is silent."
  },
  {
   "start": 549.95,
   "end": 551.95,
   "text": "So we are left with je tente."
  },
  {
   "start": 551.95,
   "end": 552.95,
   "text": "Je tente."
  },
  {
   "start": 552.95,
   "end": 554.95,
   "text": "We do not hear that D anymore."
  },
  {
   "start": 554.95,
   "end": 556.95,
   "text": "You wait."
  },
  {
   "start": 557.95,
   "end": 558.95,
   "text": "Tu attends."
  },
  {
   "start": 558.95,
   "end": 559.95,
   "text": "Tu attends."
  },
  {
   "start": 559.95,
   "end": 560.95,
   "text": "The same."
  },
  {
   "start": 560.95,
   "end": 563.95,
   "text": "We have an S now, which means we don't hear the D or the S."
  },
  {
   "start": 563.95,
   "end": 564.95,
   "text": "Tu attends."
  },
  {
   "start": 564.95,
   "end": 566.95,
   "text": "Are you waiting for me?"
  },
  {
   "start": 568.95,
